    "### Multi-Head Attention\n",
    "\n",
    "Instead of one attention calculation, Transformers use many:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Head 1 → Grammar\n",
    "Head 2 → Meaning\n",
    "Head 3 → Relationships\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "This allows learning different patterns simultaneously.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Layer Normalization\n",
    "\n",
    "Normalizes activations to stabilize training.\n",
    "\n",
    "Helps:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Faster convergence\n",
    "* Better optimization"
   ]
