    "### Self-Attention\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT uses self-attention to understand relationships between words.\n",
    "\n",
    "Core formula:\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathrm{Attention}(Q,K,V)=\\mathrm{softmax}\\left(\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right)V\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Where\n",
    "\n",
    "| Symbol | Purpose |\n",
    "| ------ | ------- |\n",
    "| Q      | Query   |\n",
    "| K      | Key     |\n",
    "| V      | Value   |\n",
    "\n",
    "The model learns:\n",
    "\n",
    "* which previous words matter\n",
    "* how strongly they matter\n",
    "\n",
    "### Masked Attention\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT is autoregressive.\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "\n",
    "* it predicts one token at a time\n",
    "* cannot see future words\n",
    "\n",
    "**Example**\n",
    "\n",
    "Sentence:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"I love deep learning\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "While predicting “deep”:\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT can only see:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"I love\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "NOT:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "\"learning\"\n",
    "```"
   ]
