    "## Decoder Block Structure\n",
    "\n",
    "Each GPT block contains:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Masked Multi-Head Attention\n",
    "2. Add & Normalize\n",
    "3. Feed Forward Network\n",
    "4. Add & Normalize\n",
    "\n",
    "Repeated many times.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Multi-Head Attention\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT uses multiple attention heads.\n",
    "\n",
    "Each head learns different patterns.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Head   | Learns                  |\n",
    "| ------ | ----------------------- |\n",
    "| Head 1 | Grammar                 |\n",
    "| Head 2 | Pronouns                |\n",
    "| Head 3 | Semantics               |\n",
    "| Head 4 | Long-range dependencies |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Feed Forward Network\n",
    "\n",
    "After attention:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Linear → GELU/ReLU → Linear\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "This helps transform representations.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Residual Connections\n",
    "\n",
    "GPT uses skip connections:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "Output = Layer(x) + x\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Benefits:\n",
    "\n",
    "* stable gradients\n",
    "* deeper models\n",
    "* easier optimization\n",
    "\n",
    "### Layer Normalization\n",
    "\n",
    "Normalizes activations for stable training.\n",
    "\n",
    "Benefits:\n",
    "\n",
    "* faster convergence\n",
    "* improved learning stability"
